'''Pigmen''', which are also known as '''Zombie Pigmen''', were neutral mobs that spawned in the [[Blazing Fortress]]. They do not serve as a base for any [[Collections]], but they drop [[Gold Nugget]]s. They are neutral as long as players don't provoke them. If one player attacks any '''Pigman''', they will all become aggressive to the attacking player. '''Pigmen''' in the [[Crimson Isle]] will still be provoked even if the player travels to a different map and then back to the Crimson Isle. '''Pigman''' [[Bestiary]] can still be obtained by killing the '''Pigmen''' on [[Magma Cube Rider|Magma Cube Riders]].

This mob had 240 {{Stat|hp|short=n}} and dealt 125 {{Stat|dmg|short=n}}.

